@startuml sequence-auth
title 【シーケンス図】認証

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

actor Client
participant "JwtFilter" as JwtFilter
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "AuthenticationManager" as AuthManager
participant "CustomUserDetailsService" as UserDetailsService
participant "UserApplicationService" as UserAppService
participant "JwtApplicationService" as JwtService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "UserLoginHistoryRepository" as HistoryRepo

note over Client, HistoryRepo
  JwtFilter は認証必須APIへの全リクエストをインターセプトし、CookieのJWTを検証して
  SecurityContextに認証情報をセットする（JWTが期限切れでも有効なリフレッシュトークンがあれば再発行する）。
  ログイン・トークンリフレッシュ・パスワードリセット（/api/password-reset/*）等の公開パスは検証対象外。
  ※ この前提処理は他のシーケンス図では省略し、本図に集約している。
end note

' ============================================================
' ログイン
' ============================================================
== ログイン (POST /api/auth/login) ==

Client -> AuthController : POST /api/auth/login\n{emailAddress, password}

note over AuthController
  JwtフィルターはSpring Securityの認証パスとして除外される
end note

AuthController -> AuthManager : authenticate(\n  UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(email, password)\n)

AuthManager -> UserDetailsService : loadUserByUsername(email)
UserDetailsService -> UserRepo : findUserByEmailAddress(EmailAddress)
UserRepo --> UserDetailsService : Optional<User>
UserDetailsService --> AuthManager : UserDetails

note over AuthManager
  パスワード照合（BCrypt）
end note

AuthManager --> AuthController : Authentication（成功）

AuthController -> UserAppService : updateUserLoginHistory(LoginHistoryCreateCommand)
  UserAppService -> UserRepo : findUserByEmailAddress(email)
  UserRepo --> UserAppService : User
  UserAppService -> HistoryRepo : findUserLoginHistoryByUserId(userId)
  HistoryRepo --> UserAppService : Optional<UserLoginHistory>

  alt 初回ログイン（レコードなし）
    UserAppService -> HistoryRepo : save(UserLoginHistory.create(userId))
  else 2回目以降（レコードあり）
    UserAppService -> HistoryRepo : save(history.update())
  end

AuthController -> JwtService : generateJwtToken(authentication.getName())
JwtService --> AuthController : jwtToken
AuthController -> JwtService : generateRefreshToken(name, rememberMe)
JwtService --> AuthController : refreshToken
AuthController -> JwtService : setJwtTokenToResponseCookie(response, jwtToken)
AuthController -> JwtService : setRefreshTokenToResponseCookie(response, refreshToken, rememberMe)

AuthController --> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=...; refreshToken=...

' ============================================================
' ログアウト
' ============================================================
== ログアウト (POST /api/auth/logout) ==

Client -> AuthController : POST /api/auth/logout\n(Cookie: jwt, refreshToken)

AuthController -> JwtService : clearJwtAndRefreshToken(response)
note right: Cookieの有効期限を0にして削除

AuthController --> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=（削除）; refreshToken=（削除）

' ============================================================
' トークンリフレッシュ
' ============================================================
== トークンリフレッシュ (GET /api/auth/refresh) ==

note over Client
  JWTの有効期限切れ時に呼び出す。
  リフレッシュトークンが有効であれば新しいJWT・リフレッシュトークンを取得できる。
end note

Client -> JwtFilter : GET /api/auth/refresh\n(Cookie: jwt=期限切れ, refreshToken=有効)

JwtFilter -> JwtService : getJwtFromRequestHeader(request)
JwtService --> JwtFilter : jwt（期限切れ）
JwtFilter -> JwtService : isTokenExpired(jwt) → true

JwtFilter -> JwtService : getRefreshTokenFromCookie(request)
JwtService --> JwtFilter : refreshToken
JwtFilter -> JwtService : isTokenFormatValid(refreshToken) → true
JwtFilter -> JwtService : isTokenExpired(refreshToken) → false

JwtFilter -> JwtService : extractSubjectFromToken(refreshToken)
JwtService --> JwtFilter : userId
JwtFilter -> UserDetailsService : loadUserById(userId)
UserDetailsService --> JwtFilter : UserDetails
JwtFilter -> JwtService : getRememberMeFromToken(refreshToken)
JwtService --> JwtFilter : rememberMe

JwtFilter -> JwtService : generateJwtToken(userId) → newJwt
JwtFilter -> JwtService : generateRefreshToken(userId, rememberMe) → newRefreshToken
JwtFilter -> JwtService : setJwtTokenToResponseCookie(response, newJwt)
JwtFilter -> JwtService : setRefreshTokenToResponseCookie(response, newRefreshToken, rememberMe)
JwtFilter -> JwtService : setTokenToSecurityContext(request, userDetails)

JwtFilter -> AuthController : フィルター通過 → refreshAuth()
AuthController --> Client : 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=新JWT; refreshToken=新RefreshToken

@enduml
